		{
			dependencies: ["5693331C34A5A291"]
			description: ["Naquadah sits deep under Venus's lava seas, with some plutonium mixed in. Dig down for raw naquadah and raw plutonium and pack a &6Venusian Naquadah Vein Sample&r."]
