		{
			dependencies: ["1B1714A8E0124C58"]
			description: ["Ender pearls and helium-3 from home, sealed under Venusian regolith in a chemical reactor, make a &6Venusian Quantum Seed&r, and only here. Blow it up with a singularity back home for the Venus bridge's pair."]
