			x: 32.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14C75CDBACADEE5A"]
			description: ["Fluoroantimonic acid, the strongest acid there is, gets made and used up inside the plant. What leaves is &6Naquadah Dust&r, plus titanium and gallium half the time, and that titanium is the one exception to the Moon's monopoly."]
			icon: "gtceu:naquadah_dust"
			id: "1D2410B18346F998"
